Subject: [PATCH 5/8] x86/ticketlock: make __ticket_spin_lock common
Date: Thu, 23 Jun 2011 18:19:17 -0700
Message-Id: <11b6893703912054024bdb60251ed944f31cbafe.1308878118.git.jeremy.fitzhardinge@citrix.com>
